    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's certifications, GDPR instruments, AI security controls, audit capabilities, and experience with EU regulatory frameworks (GDPR, EU AI Act, RGS, SecNumCloud, NIS2) as of 2024, what are the key security and compliance risks our company's need to address, and how can our company's demonstrate our company's ability to meet the key security and compliance risks we need to address?" ;
