    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the client's requirements, our company's need to focus on maintaining confidentiality, integrity, and availability of sensitive data. our company's encryption methods, including TLS 1.3 for data in transit and AES-256 for data at rest, along with EU-based key management, will ensure the protection of sensitive information." ;
