    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Strict partitioning with logical isolation per client and per mission, combined with access controls and role-based access control (RBAC), prevent unauthorized access. our company's experience with GDPR delivery to clients bound by professional secrecy and our company's familiarity with anti-money laundering frameworks (LCB-FT) will help our company's navigate these regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The segregation of duties between development and production operations, secure software development lifecycle practices, and periodic penetration testing will further mitigate security risks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To demonstrate our company's ability to meet the client's requirements, our company's can provide evidence of our company's certifications, data protection measures such as pseudonymisation, data minimisation, and configurable retention aligned with legal archival obligations. our company's audit logging capabilities, appointment of a Data Protection Officer (DPO), maintenance of a data processing register, and availability of a Data Processing Agreement (DPA) aligned with GDPR Article 28 will also be essential in showcasing compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the reference year is 2025, it's worth noting that while our company's current context does not explicitly mention EU AI Act or NIS2 as of 2024, our company's existing certifications and security controls provide a solid foundation for addressing emerging regulatory requirements. our company's should continue to monitor updates in these areas to ensure ongoing compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client's tender includes requirements for strict confidentiality obligations, professional secrecy, and auditor independence." ;
