        ex:hasText "Considering our company's legal standing, procurement experience across EU jurisdictions, IP model, insurance, standard contractual clauses, and AI regulatory posture (GDPR, EU AI Act) as of 2024, what are the potential legal risks and liabilities our company's might face, and how can our company's ensure compliance with the potential legal risks and liabilities we might face?" ;
