        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance, our company's should conduct a thorough review of The client's tender requirements, our company's standard contractual clauses, and our company's AI regulatory posture. our company's must also verify that our company's professional liability insurance coverage is sufficient, with 10 million euros per claim, and that our company's general civil liability cover is adequate." ;
