        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To optimize costs, our company's can favor a cost-efficient configuration, such as the sovereign tier with the sovereign European model, which is the most cost-efficient on the recurring side. a cost-efficient configuration, such as the sovereign tier with the sovereign European model, which is the most cost-efficient on the recurring side will help protect the gross margin and provide predictability of recurring costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, if the client requires peak resilience or maximum generative performance, our company's may need to consider the premium high-availability tier with top-tier proprietary inference, which would be materially more expensive." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Potential financial risks and trade-offs include the need to balance cost efficiency with the required level of service and performance, ensuring that the chosen configuration meets the client's needs while staying within budget." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, any changes to the requirements or budget may require re-running the three-year cost model to ensure that the solution remains cost-effective and aligned with The client's constraints. our company's finance role will work closely with the architect to keep the configuration within the SME envelope while preserving an acceptable margin, targeting a gross margin between 25% and 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an artificial intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity, quality, and reliability of work. an artificial intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity, quality, and reliability of work must provide contextualized and grounded answers, and demonstrate traceability of outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering our company's LLM stack, RAG capabilities, fine-tuning methods, explainability tools, performance benchmarks, past AI use cases, and known trade-offs as of 2024, can our company's propose an innovative AI-powered solution that meets these requirements, and what are the potential risks and challenges associated with an innovative AI-powered solution that meets these requirements development and deployment? our company's can propose an innovative AI-powered solution based on our company's Retrieval-augmented generation capabilities, which provides grounded answers by citing passages from a controlled corpus. our company's Atelier platform allows for iterative methodologies, including corpus curation, retrieval tuning, prompt design, and evaluation loops to ensure high-quality outputs. an innovative AI-powered solution based on our Retrieval-augmented generation capabilities, which provides grounded answers by citing passages from a controlled corpus will leverage source citations, retrieved passages, and retrieval traces to demonstrate explainability and traceability of outputs." ;
