    <http://example.org/node/chunk151> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Cabinet Vauclair & Associés is seeking an artificial-intelligence assistance solution to enhance productivity, quality, and reliability while preserving professional secrecy and confidentiality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk152> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Cabinet Vauclair & Associés consortium, led by Faber IA, proposes the Atelier platform, a document-grounded AI assistant tailored for regulated and document-intensive organizations like accounting and statutory-audit firms. the Atelier platform, a document-grounded AI assistant tailored for regulated and document-intensive organizations like accounting and statutory-audit firms will provide intelligent assistance in retrieving regulatory and methodological information, drafting professional documents, handling client files, and ensuring continuity of missions between collaborators. the Atelier platform, a document-grounded AI assistant tailored for regulated and document-intensive organizations like accounting and statutory-audit firms integrates with existing production tools through API-type interfaces and single sign-on (SSO), ensuring seamless interaction with the Atelier platform, a document-grounded AI assistant tailored for regulated and document-intensive organizations like accounting and statutory-audit firms software ecosystem." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk153> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address performance requirements, Cabinet Vauclair & Associés architecture leverages OuraneCloud's Sovereign tier, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, providing high availability during business hours and resilience to peak loads. the Atelier platform, a document-grounded AI assistant tailored for regulated and document-intensive organizations like accounting and statutory-audit firmsrm, a document-grounded AI assistant tailored for regulated and document-intensive organizations like accounting and statutory-audit firms platform's median latency of 1.3 seconds and p95 latency below 2.5 seconds for common queries meet the client's response time requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk154> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Cabinet Vauclair & Associés prioritize confidentiality, integrity, and availability of sensitive data through encryption methods (TLS 1.3 for data in transit and AES-256 for data at rest), strict partitioning with logical isolation per client and per mission, and access controls based on role-based access control (RBAC)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk155> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Cabinet Vauclair & Associés ISO 27001 certification since 2023 and ISO 27701 certification for privacy information management extension demonstrate Cabinet Vauclair & Associés commitment to information security management and GDPR compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

